  "claudeFinalResponse": "Claude responded: Every changed row checks out.\nDiff revised rows against the original MCQ file\n\nDiff revised rows against the original MCQ file\n\nEvery changed row checks out. Last check: that no “solid substance” alimento gloss is left anywhere in the original file outside these rows:\n\nList every alimento occurrence in the original file\n\nList every alimento occurrence in the original file\n\nNone of the 64 revised rows adds a new valid wrong answer, and every issue I reported is fixed. I have no remaining MCQ ambiguity to report.\n\nCounts: 64 rows changed. 60 have new distractors (#1281 has two, so 61 swaps in total), and 4 only have the new alimento wording (#628, #637, #640, #650). The original file used the old “solid substance” wording in exactly those 4 places, so it’s gone everywhere. Nothing else changed: no other glosses were edited, no distractor repeats its target or appears twice in a row, and each row still has three distractors.\n\nNew distractors: I read all 61 swaps against their targets, and none could reasonably be a meaning of the target. Two pairs looked worth a closer look, and both are fine:\n\n#1276, #1280, #1281: precisamente (“precisely”) now appears as a distractor for directamente, solamente and simplemente. It means “exactly”, not “only”, “simply” or “directly”.\n#901 disponer: the remaining aprobar (“to approve”) doesn’t match disponer’s “decree/order” sense.\n\nIssues I reported earlier:\n\nThe 8 confirmed collisions are fixed: #305, #357, #397, #901, #1280, #1281, #1430 and #1455.\nThe weaker overlaps are fixed: #466, #1078/#1082, #1247, #361/#366, #1451/#1460 and #505/#542.\nPairs you replaced as a precaution are also fine: #584, #796, #633, #1127, #1191 and the others.\n#650 alimento: “food; nourishment” agrees with the DLE.\n\nLeft as they are: I agree with keeping these:\n\nsanitario = sanitary: a narrow but valid gloss, not a false answer.\nThe coger warning: a display choice, with no answer collision.\nThe three remote pairs (equipo/system, simple/normal, pretender/state): none needs a change.\n\n\n\n\n\njust now",
